'''Ruzafa''' (from {{Langx|ar|رصافة|Ruṣāfa|fragrant garden}}), also spelled '''Russafa''', is a [[Communes of Balisca|barrio]] located in the [[Llanito]] borough of [[Castejón]]. It is separated from [[Arrabád]] by the [[Guadalquiton]] ({{Literal translation|cat's river}}). 

